<Slide style={{ width: '1280px', height: '720px', background: '#FFFFFF', padding: '20px 70px', display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column' }}><Box style={{ height: 100, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'flex-end' }}><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 6 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#7A8699', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.4, letterSpacing: 1 }}>03 / 单题引擎</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 32, color: '#0E2340', fontWeight: 700, lineHeight: 1.3 }}>手写笔迹时间戳：从最终卷面看到作答过程</Text></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', padding: '7px 16px', borderRadius: 20, background: '#98A2B3' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 600 }}>待研究</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ height: 532, paddingTop: 8, flexDirection: 'column' }}><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 28, flex: 1 }}><Box style={{ width: 620, justifyContent: 'center' }}><svg width={620} height={400} viewBox='0 0 620 400'><rect x='0' y='0' width='620' height='400' rx='8' fill='#FFFFFF' stroke='#E3E8EF' stroke-width='1.5'/><rect x='0' y='0' width='620' height='40' rx='8' fill='#0E2340'/><rect x='0' y='26' width='620' height='14' fill='#0E2340'/><text x='16' y='26' font-size='15' fill='#FFFFFF' text-anchor='start' font-weight='600'>StudyAgent</text><rect x='18' y='58' width='584' height='26' rx='4' fill='#F5F7FA'/><text x='30' y='76' font-size='14' fill='#0E2340' text-anchor='start' font-weight='600'>笔迹回放 · 题目：解析几何大题</text><rect x='18' y='92' width='584' height='150' rx='6' fill='#F5F7FA' stroke='#7A8699' stroke-width='1' stroke-dasharray='5 4'/><text x='310.0' y='114' font-size='15' fill='#7A8699' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>手写作答画布（回放中）</text><rect x='40' y='136' width='528' height='9' rx='4' fill='#DFE6EF'/><rect x='542' y='136' width='46' height='9' rx='4' fill='#CBD8E8'/><rect x='40' y='166' width='458' height='9' rx='4' fill='#E9EFF6'/><rect x='542' y='166' width='46' height='9' rx='4' fill='#CBD8E8'/><rect x='40' y='196' width='388' height='9' rx='4' fill='#DFE6EF'/><rect x='542' y='196' width='46' height='9' rx='4' fill='#CBD8E8'/><rect x='18' y='254' width='584' height='26' rx='4' fill='#F5F7FA'/><text x='30' y='272' font-size='14' fill='#0E2340' text-anchor='start' font-weight='600'>时间轴：00:00 ──●─────●────────── 04:32</text><rect x='18' y='288' width='584' height='28' rx='14' fill='#EAF3FD'/><text x='30' y='307' font-size='14' fill='#1E7BE0' text-anchor='start' font-weight='600'>事件：00:42 划去重写 · 01:58 返回前一步 · 03:10 查看答案</text><rect x='18' y='324' width='584' height='34' rx='17' fill='#1E7BE0'/><text x='310.0' y='347' font-size='15' fill='#FFFFFF' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>播放 / 拖动定位 / 跳到批改结论</text><text x='608' y='390' font-size='12' fill='#7A8699' text-anchor='end' font-weight='400'>示意占位 · S03</text></svg></Box><Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 10, justifyContent: 'center' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 21, color: '#0E2340', fontWeight: 700, lineHeight: 1.4 }}>界面要点</Text><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 9 }}><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 12, alignItems: 'flex-start' }}><Box style={{ width: 8, height: 8, borderRadius: 4, background: '#1E7BE0', marginTop: 9 }} /><Box style={{ flex: 1 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#333A45', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>面向无纸化场景，通过平板和手写笔记录作答，将每一笔及修改操作与发生时间关联。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 12, alignItems: 'flex-start' }}><Box style={{ width: 8, height: 8, borderRadius: 4, background: '#1E7BE0', marginTop: 9 }} /><Box style={{ flex: 1 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#333A45', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>除最终卷面外还能查看：按什么顺序书写、在哪里停顿、何时回到前一步修改、错误是否被学生自行纠正。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 12, alignItems: 'flex-start' }}><Box style={{ width: 8, height: 8, borderRadius: 4, background: '#1E7BE0', marginTop: 9 }} /><Box style={{ flex: 1 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#333A45', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>关键价值：最终答案正确时，时间线仍可能显示学生先列错式随后划去重写。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 12, alignItems: 'flex-start' }}><Box style={{ width: 8, height: 8, borderRadius: 4, background: '#1E7BE0', marginTop: 9 }} /><Box style={{ flex: 1 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#333A45', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>时间口径：以同一作答会话的连续相对时间为主，不能只使用上传或保存时间替代真实书写时间。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 12, alignItems: 'flex-start' }}><Box style={{ width: 8, height: 8, borderRadius: 4, background: '#1E7BE0', marginTop: 9 }} /><Box style={{ flex: 1 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#333A45', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>压力、倾角可按设备能力附加，首期不作为必需输入。</Text></Box></Box></Box><Box style={{ marginTop: 6, padding: '9px 14px', background: '#F5F7FA', borderRadius: 6, alignSelf: 'flex-start' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#7A8699', fontWeight: 600, lineHeight: 1.4 }}>示意占位 S03 · 待替换为实际截图</Text></Box></Box></Box></Box><Box style={{ height: 40, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center', borderTop: '1px solid #E3E8EF', marginTop: 8 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#7A8699', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.4 }}>依据：单题功能设计思路.md §3.3</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#7A8699', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.4 }}> 27 / 124 </Text></Box></Slide>